# BUILD.gn for apk-installer module
#
# L02.A01 package-boundary verifier/parser. This library is deliberately
# read-only: BMS owns the transaction and installs owns privileged publication.
#
# This module is dlopen'd by BMS and returns the current GameInstallPlanWire.

